      "final_answer": "If you\u2019re a TrailPlus member, the return policy is the same as the standard policy except for a longer return window:\n\n**Return window** \u2013 You have **45\u202fcalendar days from delivery** to request a return, provided your TrailPlus membership was active when the order was placed. If the membership started after you placed the order, the standard 30\u2011day window applies\u301009-trailplus-membership.md \u2014 Return window\u3011.\n\nAll other return conditions remain unchanged:\n\n* **Item condition** \u2013 The item must be unused, unwashed, and in resalable condition with all original tags, accessories, and packaging\u301001-returns-policy-current.md \u2014 Item condition\u3011.  \n* **Return shipping fee** \u2013 A **$6.95 return\u2011shipping fee** is deducted from the refund for standard domestic returns, unless we sent the wrong item or it arrived damaged\u301001-returns-policy-current.md \u2014 Return shipping and refunds\u3011.  \n* **Refund timing** \u2013 Refunds are issued to the original payment method after inspection, typically within **5\u20137\u202fbusiness days**\u301001-returns-policy-current.md \u2014 Return shipping and refunds\u3011.  \n* **Exclusions** \u2013 Final\u2011sale items and gift cards are still non\u2011returnable for a change of mind, and warranty claims are handled separately\u301001-returns-policy-current.md \u2014 Exclusions and exceptions\u3011.\n\nSo, the primary benefit for TrailPlus members is the extended 45\u2011day return period; all other return rules stay the same.",
